msgid ""
"Verify the integrity of ``backup-header`` using ``backup-header.hmac`` (an "
"encrypted *and integrity protected* version of ``backup-header``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/backup-emergency-restore-v4.rst:110
#: 3fbdc1eb36b04b409185e5a1257fe0b3
msgid ""
"**Note:** If this command fails, it may be that the backup was tampered with "
"or is in a different format. In the latter case, look inside ``backup-"
"header`` at the ``version`` field. If it contains a value other than "
"``version=4``, go to the instructions for that format version:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/backup-emergency-restore-v4.rst:112
#: c8e455ac6cad47209c3d24959dcf9419
msgid ""
":doc:`Emergency Backup Recovery without Qubes (v2) </user/how-to-guides/"
